WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.973
This is the first part of a three-part illusion.

00:00:03.973 --> 00:00:05.619
What do you see?

00:00:05.619 --> 00:00:09.012
Well, there's a window and it's turning...

00:00:09.012 --> 00:00:13.588
Except it stops and reverses direction.

00:00:13.588 --> 00:00:20.000
I'm going to attach this Rubik's Cube to the short side of the trapezoid.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.340
Okay the Rubik's&nbsp;
Cube is going around... but now, what is that?&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:31.560
It looks like the Rubik's Cube&nbsp;
is continuing to go around&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:34.495
but the window is oscillating back and forth.

00:00:34.495 --> 00:00:38.100
Okay&nbsp;new plan, I'm going to take off the Rubik's Cube

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:43.332
and I'm going to put a ruler right through the&nbsp;
middle of the window.

00:00:43.332 --> 00:00:45.660
Okay the ruler is rotating

00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:52.680
around but wait now the window is going backwards!&nbsp;
Whoa whoa the ruler is going through the window&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.680 --> 00:01:00.026
it is doing things which I know are physically&nbsp;
impossible but that is how my brain is seeing it.

